  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pakistan REDD  Preparation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the proposed Readiness Preparation Activities is to strengthencapacity of the Government of Pakistan to monitor deforestation and manage forest and land usechange related greenhouse gas emissions through a socially, environmentally and technicallysound national REDD+ strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
